{
    "id":  11068,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "Black Remote Control - CCT Light Remote - 4 Zones",
    "reference":  "92058-C1",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eThe remote control supports individual 4-zone control. One remote can work with unlimited receivers within 30m, can dim brightness and color temperature, and is compatible with 2.4G as controllers and lights.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eEasily create a portable and convenient lighting scene.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eBlack Remote Control - CCT Light Remote - 4 Zones\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInnovation and Control in the Palm of Your Hand\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe 4-Zone CCT Remote Control is a revolutionary tool designed to give you maximum control over the lighting in your spaces.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eLimitless Versatility\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEquipped to manage up to 4 different zones, adjusting light individually in different areas. Bright energizing light in the kitchen, warm relaxing light in the living room, soft tone in the bedroom.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eColor Temperature Control (CCT)\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCCT technology adjusts LED color temperature between warm (2700K) and cool (6500K) tones.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eIntuitive Interface and Elegant Design\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eErgonomic modern design. Clearly labeled, backlit buttons.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eAdvanced Features\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePrecision Dimmer, Pre-set Modes, Preference Memory, Extended Control Range (30m).\u003c/p\u003e",
